   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# MODEL FAMILY: PONY V7 (AuraFlow)\n\n**Compatible model examples / model location:**\ndiffusion_models/pony_v7_base_int8_convrot.safetensors (UNETLoader; int8 + ConvRot made locally, ~1 s/step at 1024²).. Not compatible with Pony XL / SDXL checkpoints or SDXL LoRAs.\n\n**Important:** CLIPLoader = `pony_v7_pile_t5xl_fp16.safetensors` (Pile T5-XL, auto-detected; the type dropdown doesn't matter) followed by T5 Tokenizer Options 768/768; VAELoader = `pony_v7_sdxl_vae_fp16.safetensors`. 768-1536px, 30+ steps, CFG ~3.5, euler / simple.\n\n**Prompt order:** special tags (`score_9`, `style_cluster_N`, `rating_safe/explicit`), then a one-phrase factual description (`<species> <gender> <name> from <source>`), then style, then extra tags. Quality tags are much weaker than in V6.\n\n**Ollama caption model vs image model:** In `Qwen3VLAbliteratedPromptPair`, `huihui_ai/qwen3-vl-abliterated:8b-instruct` is an **Ollama image-analysis model**, not your generation checkpoint.\n\n**ComfyUI limitation:** Standard dropdowns still list all matching file types from shared folders; this note and labeled loader indicate what is appropriate, but do not restrict dropdown contents."
   ],
   "title": "MODEL GUIDE — READ BEFORE SELECTING",
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#161616"
  },
